# 01_prov.kzp -- the cited texts of profile c1-bp-b051eb0 that are the same in every variant.
#
# File paths are relative to the root of a C1 source view: bp/ (nasa/bp b051eb0), cf/ (nasa/CF 281a941 or
# 833fdbb), cfe/ and osal/ (the cFE and OSAL of the cFS bundle candidate 1df262a or 1b0b338).  The view is
# not a repository: kz-phi verify-prov --root <view> re-reads every citation (docs/c1_smoke_observe.md
# says how the views are made).  Each sha256 is that of the cited lines, each followed by LF, the value of
# `sed -n 'A,Bp' FILE | sha256sum`, computed from the pinned trees for this profile; nothing is quoted
# from memory.  The CF records here cite texts that 281a941 -> 833fdbb did not change
# (plan/C1_basis_plan.md 9.8: docs/, cf_events.h, cf_app.c are unchanged), the OSAL and cFE records files
# that are byte-identical in the two bundle candidates (checked with cmp for this profile).
phi 1;

