# ---- 2026-10-24 (C1 state-based): the start state, the end of a lifetime and the key separation of the OSAL
# object table, the reads-from of a successful lookup, the shutdown scope and the exit of an application.  The
# cited OSAL, cFE and PSP files are byte-identical in the two bundle candidates (cmp; the PSP is bd4a2ea in both).
